Package: ladybird-xios-launcher
Name: Ladybird Xios Launcher
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Author: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Depends: ladybird-app (>= 0.1.22+ios1), uikittools
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Description: Xios desktop launcher for the standalone Ladybird browser
 Installs a freedesktop .desktop entry and hicolor icon for Ladybird so iosc,
 GNOME, KDE, and the Xios launcher tooling can show the standalone UIKit browser
 alongside compositor desktop apps.
 .
 The launcher foregrounds the already-installed Ladybird iPadOS app with uiopen;
 it does not embed Ladybird as a Wayland client.
